t"}],"body":{"size":5236,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"Get Access to the Q1 Macro Themes Call\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2024-01-05-2sg52dh/2sg5963/1548533315/h/DYSkzT8fpH2TKoui8YVBi-aJtuC7ERCD3EjcIxNDSFs\r\n\r\nJoin us tomorrow at 11:00am ET for our highly anticipated Q1 2024 Quarterly Macro Themes presentation hosted by our Founder and Risk-Manager-In-Chief Keith McCullough.\r\n\r\nKeith will dig deep into the three big investing themes our Macro team believes will (meaningfully) drive your portfolio returns in coming months.\r\n\r\nFYI—Quarterly Macro Themes is arguably our most important offering to subscribers. For years, it was exclusively available to our Institutional subscribers. We recently opened it up to our Macro Pro subscribers.\r\n\r\nHere’s a sneak peek inside the presentation:\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUSA Hitting Back-To-Back Monthly #Quad4s\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Big (G): Deficits &amp; Debt Updated\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLong India and Gold vs. Short Japan\r\n\r\nPrepare your portfolio for the quarter and year ahead.\r\n\r\nGET ACCESS NOW: https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2024-01-05-2sg52dh/2sg5963/1548533315/h/DYSkzT8fpH2TKoui8YVBi-aJtuC7ERCD3EjcIxNDSFs\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nTHIS WEEK ON HEDGEYE TV\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ith-category-43-the-macro-show/2sg5966/1548533315/h/DYSkzT8fpH2TKoui8YVBi-aJtuC7ERCD3EjcIxNDSFs\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/h-category-71-the-call-hedgeye/2sg5969/1548533315/h/DYSkzT8fpH2TKoui8YVBi-aJtuC7ERCD3EjcIxNDSFs\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ucation-subscriber-orientation/2sg596d/1548533315/h/DYSkzT8fpH2TKoui8YVBi-aJtuC7ERCD3EjcIxNDSFs\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ory-88-market-situation-report/2sg596h/1548533315/h/DYSkzT8fpH2TKoui8YVBi-aJtuC7ERCD3EjcIxNDSFs\r\n\r\nGet more Long and Short ideas with Hedgeye Sector Shows\r\n\r\n\r\nClick on the images below to watch LIVE or ON-DEMAND.\r\n\r\nhttps://info.